{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24898","headline":"省试吴宫教美人战 · 叶季良","name":"省试吴宫教美人战","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"强吴矜霸略，讲武在深宫。\n尽出娇娥妓，先观上将风。\n挥戈罗袖卷，擐甲汗妆红。\n掩笑分旗下，含羞入队中。\n鼓停行未正，刑举令才崇。\n自可威隣国，何劳逞战功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"叶季良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}